"When a video has none in your languages: its name and a fingerprint of the "
"file to subtitle services (OpenSubtitles.org, Wizdom, Gestdown, YIFY "
"Subtitles), its name to IMDb, Wikidata and Cinemeta to know the film."
msgstr ""
"Kui videol pole subtiitreid sinu keeltes: selle nimi ja faili sõrmejälg "
"subtiitriteenustele (OpenSubtitles.org, Wizdom, Gestdown, YIFY Subtitles), "
"selle nimi IMDb-le, Wikidatale ja Cinemetale filmi tuvastamiseks."

#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/firstrun/qml/OnboardingDialog.qml:252
